[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0010","text":"～～！\n这刨冰，好好吃～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0020","text":"但是，好冰……脑壳疼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0030","text":"呵呵。想快点吃的心情我也懂，\n但着急是大忌哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0040","text":"……哎呀，看起来没怎么动呢\n麻美美也头疼了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0050","text":"只是在等而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0060","text":"因为我想吃那种冰沙口感的嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0070","text":"原来如此，正要开始享受啊\n是我扫兴了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0080","text":"嗯—\n感觉不错"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0090","text":"──疼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_04_0100","text":"嘻嘻～……／呵呵……"}]
